    "detailed_description": "Sent to a planet to investigate Illegal activity your ship malfunctions, crashing onto the planet. Now stranded you must fight your way through mercenaries and alien wildlife to reach a functioning space ship to escape the planet and report to the federation. But the mercenaries weren't here to go sight seeing. Unknown radiation seeps from the ground, twisting and corrupting anything it infects. <br><br>--Ever changing world: Completing story events and progressing the story causes certain locations to change. Unlock new content through completing runs and challenges.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498970/extras/ba664e45b7cd21f321b332fb48ba7942.poster.avif?t=1740106127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498970/extras/ba664e45b7cd21f321b332fb48ba7942.webm?t=1740106127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498970/extras/ba664e45b7cd21f321b332fb48ba7942.mp4?t=1740106127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>--- Lingering Horror elements: Threats will be hunting you throughout a run. Be ready to survive against the hunter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498970/extras/76ef9b5cf9abe3e132ef9cfb2302aab7.poster.avif?t=1740106127\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498970/extras/76ef9b5cf9abe3e132ef9cfb2302aab7.webm?t=1740106127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498970/extras/76ef9b5cf9abe3e132ef9cfb2302aab7.mp4?t=1740106127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>--Survival-lite mechanics: Not all items can be useful. Carry